## Frequently asked questions

**How much does SEO in Cardiff cost?**

Local SEO campaigns for Cardiff businesses start from around **£200–£350/month**, depending on how competitive your sector is and how many areas you're targeting. [Contact us](/contact/) for a free consultation and quote.

**How long does SEO take?**

Local SEO typically takes 3–6 months to show meaningful results, but many clients see improvements within the first 4–8 weeks.

**Do I need SEO if I have a good website?**

A great [website](/web-design-cardiff/) is the foundation — but without SEO, customers may never find it. Both work together for the best results.

**What's the difference between local SEO and general SEO?**

Local SEO focuses on ranking for geographically targeted searches — "plumber in Cardiff" or "builder near Roath". It includes Google Maps / Google Business Profile alongside website rankings. Most Cardiff small businesses need local SEO rather than broad, nationwide SEO.

**Can you guarantee rankings?**

No ethical SEO agency can guarantee specific rankings. We can guarantee we'll do the right things to improve them.

**Do you work with businesses outside Cardiff?**

Yes. We provide SEO services across [South Wales](/seo-south-wales/) — including [Swansea](/seo-swansea/), [Newport](/seo-newport/), [Bridgend](/seo-bridgend/), and [Merthyr Tydfil](/seo-merthyr-tydfil/).

